OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Bake Off semi-finalist reveals
OL,4,Ashow's secrets
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs The Great British Bake Off returns
OL,7,Fto television screens tonight, a former
OL,8,Fsemi-finalist has lifted the lid on the
OL,9,Frealities of life inside the famous
OL,10,Ftent, revealing that one of the
OL,11,Ftoughest challenges was not the baking
OL,12,Fitself but keeping his appearance on
OL,13,Fthe show a secret for months.
OL,15,FToby Littlewood, who reached the
OL,16,Fsemi-final of the Channel 4 programme
OL,17,Fin 2025, said contestants often
OL,18,Fcompleted filming long before the
OL,19,Fseries aired, leaving them unable to
OL,20,Ftell friends and family about their
OL,21,Fexperience.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
