OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Bake Off semi-finalist reveals
OL,4,Ashow's secrets
OL,5,
OL,6,F"You'll have done all of the filming
OL,7,Fand then you have that period where you
OL,8,Fhave to keep a secret," he said.
OL,10,F"Now it's a huge sense of relief
OL,11,Fbecause everyone knows you've been on
OL,12,Fand the secrets that you have to keep
OL,13,Fbecome less and less every week."
